<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>503 Service Unavailable</title><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/spectre.css/dist/spectre.min.css"><style>body{margin:0;background:#f3f4f6;color:#111827;font-family:"Roboto",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh}.topbar{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:#f97316;z-index:0}.page-card{position:relative;z-index:1;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;box-shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(15,23,42,.12);border-radius:1rem;max-width:560px;width:92%;padding:2.5rem 2.25rem}.badge-soft{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(249,115,22,.06);border-radius:999px;color:#ea580c;padding:.25rem .85rem;margin-bottom:1.1rem}.badge-soft span{display:inline-block;width:.55rem;height:.55rem;border-radius:999px;background:#f97316;margin-right:.5rem;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(249,115,22,.18)}h1{margin:0 0 .85rem;font-size:2rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em}p{margin:0 0 .75rem;font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4b5563}.meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1.5rem;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b7280}.brand{font-weight:500;color:#111827}.btn-primary{border-radius:999px;padding:.6rem 1.6rem;font-size:.85rem;border:none;background:#f97316;color:#111827;font-weight:500;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(249,115,22,.35);cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,transform .15s ease}.btn-primary:focus,.btn-primary:hover{outline:none;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(249,115,22,.45);transform:translateY(-1px)}.btn-row{margin-top:1.4rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem}.hint{font-size:.75rem;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:1.2rem}</style></head><body><div class="topbar"></div><div class="page-card"><div class="meta"><div class="brand">Linuxfabrik Application Gateway</div><div>ERROR &middot; 503 SERVICE UNAVAILABLE</div></div><div class="badge-soft"><span></span>Service unavailable</div><h1>The service is temporarily unavailable.</h1><p>The server is currently unable to handle the request due to temporary overload or scheduled maintenance.</p><p>Please try again in a few minutes. If the issue persists, contact your administrator and mention the error code <strong>503</strong>.</p><div class="btn-row"><button class="btn-primary" onclick="location.reload()">Retry request</button></div><div class="hint">Reference: 503 &middot; Service Unavailable &middot; Generated by the Linuxfabrik application gateway.</div></div></body></html>